with sonic the hedgehog 2 hitting  theaters kids are sure to enjoy the  speedy antics of everyone's favorite  blue hedgehog but what about the  grown-ups is there anything in the film  for them keep watching to see the things  only adults notice and sonic the  hedgehog 2.  the opening of sonic the hedgehog 2  picks up a handful of months after the  first movie ends dr robotnik has largely  adapted to his new reality exiled on the  mushroom planet to keep himself company  as a castaway in this strange land  robotnik has made a friend for himself  that is reminiscent of wilson from the  2000 tom hanks movie castaway in that  film a lonely fedex delivery man played  by hanks spoke to a volleyball he  nicknamed wilson even going so far as to  paint a face on it the roberts of  mecca's film was a huge hit not only at  the box office but also earns the actor  an oscar nomination and a golden globe  award  from bart simpson to timmy turner  sometimes the best way to stick the  landing on an energetic pre-teen boy is  by using a grown-up woman to provide his  voice that's the case with sonic  sidekick tales as the two-tailed fox has  brought to life by veteran voice actress  colleen o'shaughnessy the industry vet  who began her career in the early 90s  via series like sailor moon and digimon  does a convincing job of bringing the  endearing character to life that won't  be surprising to older fans who have  been following the sonic video games for  years though shawnee has been voicing  tales in various games and shows for  almost a decade now as o'shaughnessy  began voicing tales in sonic games in  2014 with her first appearances as a fox  coming in sonic boom shattered crystal  for the nintendo ds handheld video game  system and sonic boom rise of lyric both  released in november 2014. she has since  voiced tales in over a dozen other sonic  games as well as the 85 episode long  sonic boom tv series  don't worry it's still covered by the  manufacturer's warranty when we first  see robotnik's lucky agent stone in  sonic the hedgehog 2 he is cranking out  cappuccinos at a coffee shop named the  mean bean cafe this name is a reference  to an old sonic the hedgehog spin-off  game called dr robotnik's mean bean  machine mean bean machine was first  released on the sega genesis in 1993. it  was a brightly coloured falling block  puzzle game where you must match up  beans in groups to clear the board and  there was an almost direct translation  to english from the japanese game puyo  puyo replacing the original designs with  sonic characters  not every adult targeted sonic 2 joke  refers to an old video game or movie  kids might find themselves wondering why  agent stone is so fiercely loyal to an  office rocker madman who frequently puts  him in painful situations adults on the  other hand might see a romance blooming  the robotnik stone relationship has tons  of suggestive subtext particularly at  the beginning of the film the two have  been separated for some time and stone  is methodically fashioning images of the  duo into latte foam complete with cute  hearts he seems to be the smithers to  robotnik's mr burns and much like  smithers he'll endure any humiliation if  it means he can remain in the orbit of  his apparent crush the suggestion that  stone is into robotnik as more than just  a boss is shown in multiple scenes like  one where we see him playing virtual  dress-up with robotnik on his computer  stone's desire to see his boss happy  despite the way robotnik treats him as  disposable reinforces that this desire  is more than simply professional  early in the movie tom is concerned  about sonic's well-being after settling  into green hills following the events of  the first sonic the hedgehog movie the  blue speed demon has been having trouble  finding his calling a wannabe superhero  the hedgehog goes around bungling crimes  in progress sometimes saving the day but  often in the most expensive ineffective  ways possible in an attempt to be the  hero he thinks everyone needs him to be  sonic finds himself rudderless tom tells  sonic that his time will come and that  fate will tell him he doesn't need to  force that moment to happen that moment  chooses you i just got goosebumps wait a  second did you steal that from oprah  this goes on to be one of the relevant  themes of the movie and what motivates  its main character tom is concerned that  sonic needs to find friends and peers  that are more like him which ends up  happening when tails and knuckles enter  the story it's only near the end of the  movie that we see this journey completed  though sonic tails and knuckles have  formed bonds and matured together for a  greater purpose and as the film teases a  new threat for sonic the hedgehog 3 they  stand united to battle him  in the first film audiences learn that  sonic was raised by a clan of great owls  from a faraway dimension in sonic the  hedgehog 2 it's revealed that the owls  in particular sonic's maternal figure  longclaw are the rivals of the echidna  clan that knuckles was born into making  sonic and knuckles sworn enemies by  birth in reality both of these animals  exist here on earth while hedgehogs and  echidnas may look similar to the  untrained eye they are quite different  creatures an echidna has a thinner  longer muzzle and sharper quills and  hedgehogs have smaller feet while  echidnas grow longer toenails named for  a greek mythological half monster  echidnas can be found in new guinea and  mainland australia along with tasmania  and as far as we know they are not  engaged in conflict in some wild space  dimension  the main plot for dr robotnik and sonic  the hedgehog 2 centers around a team up  between the mad scientist and knuckles  the echidna has a lifelong rivalry  against the owl clan that race sonic and  therefore has a grudge against the blue  speedster the same sense of duty that  leads knuckles to despise sonic without  even getting to know him drives a red 